# Build context allowlist for be/Dockerfile (BuildKit reads <Dockerfile>.dockerignore).
# Last matching line wins: the exclusions below must stay after the `!` lines.
*
!package.json
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!be/
be/node_modules
be/dist
be/test
be/coverage
be/keys/
**/.keys/
**/.env*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/.npmrc
**/*.log
